  "body": "## What's Changed\n* build(deps): bump taiki-e/install-action from 2.87.30 to 2.88.0 in the github-actions group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/301\n* ci: add armv7-unknown-linux-musleabihf release target by @tioan in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/303\n* docs: install on OpenWrt with the static musl binaries by @tioan in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/304\n* test: wait for the PSK handshake before cancelling the infinite PSK test by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/305\n* fix: give each server on a host its own mDNS instance name by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/306\n* fix: install.sh on ARMv7 and musl-only systems (OpenWrt, Alpine) by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/307\n* test: run spawned xfr binaries in an isolated environment by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/309\n* fix: clearer QUIC timeout, PSK mismatch and IPv6 connect messages by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/310\n* chore: replace chrono with jiff for ISO 8601 timestamps by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/308\n\n## New Contributors\n* @tioan made their first contribution in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/303\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/lance0/xfr/compare/v0.14.0...v0.14.1",
